[s46] dry-run: would connect acme
[s46] team:    acme · lane: EU-OPO · endpoint: https://acme.s46.dev
[s46] Configure Codex profile for Sovereign46
[s46] harness: codex (would write ~/.codex/config.toml, profile: s46)
  - add or replace [model_providers.s46]
  - add or replace [profiles.s46]
  - set token_helper to 's46 token --refresh'
  - set model to s46/kimi-k2.6

--- ~/.codex/config.toml
+++ ~/.codex/config.toml
@@ -1,0 +1,13 @@
+# BEGIN s46
